	  <Company>NextGen Software Ltd</Company>
	  <Product>HoloNET Holochain Client</Product>
	  <Title>HoloNET Holochain Client</Title>
    <Description>The definitive Holochain .NET client — fully supporting Holochain 0.7.1 and 0.7.0 (Kitsune2/iroh networking, paginated DumpOpTimings, AwaitingMemproofs status, clone cells, countersigning, WASM host functions, and the full Admin conductor API). Connect any .NET app, game, or service to a Holochain hApp with a clean async/await + event-driven API. Auto-manages conductor start/stop in embedded mode (hc.exe + holochain.exe bundled). Ships as both a lightweight (no binaries) and embedded (binaries included) NuGet package. Includes HoloNETClientAdmin (full admin events, GenerateAgentPubKey, InstallApp, EnableApp, AuthorizeSigningCredentials, DumpOpTimings, and more), HoloNETClientAppAgent for zome calls, and full HoloNETConfig for Kitsune2/keystore/WASM/cache tuning. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp</Description>
	  <Summary Condition="'$(Embedded)' != 'true'">The world's first .NET &amp; Unity client for Holochain — now fully supporting Holochain 0.7.1 and 0.7.0 with Kitsune2/iroh networking, paginated DumpOpTimings, AwaitingMemproofs, and the complete conductor API.</Summary>
	  <Description Condition="'$(Embedded)' != 'true'">The world's first .NET &amp; Unity client for Holochain. Fully supporting Holochain 0.7.1 and 0.7.0 — Kitsune2/iroh (QUIC) as sole network backend (tx5/WebRTC removed), new paginated DumpOpTimings admin and app API, AwaitingMemproofs app status, updated AdminWebsocket and AppWebsocket conductor APIs. Lightweight version: does not bundle the Holochain binaries. Use NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.Client.Embedded if you want the conductor auto-started and managed for you.</Description>
	  <Summary Condition="'$(Embedded)' == 'true'">The world's first .NET &amp; Unity client for Holochain — supporting Holochain 0.7.1 and 0.7.0, with hc.exe and holochain.exe bundled so the conductor is auto-started and managed for you.</Summary>
	  <Description Condition="'$(Embedded)' == 'true'">The world's first .NET &amp; Unity client for Holochain. Fully supporting Holochain 0.7.1 and 0.7.0 — Kitsune2/iroh (QUIC) networking, paginated DumpOpTimings, AwaitingMemproofs app status, and the complete conductor API. This version bundles hc.exe and holochain.exe (v0.7.1 or v0.7.0) so the Holochain Conductor is auto-started and managed for you. Set HolochainConductorMode.UseEmbedded to activate. For the lightweight version without binaries use NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.Client.</Description>
